            "children": [],
            "answer": {
              "short": "Possible, but not established: four observed colours do not determine the number of marbles.",
              "worked": "The bag could contain one marble of each colour, with chance producing unequal frequencies. It could also contain several marbles of each colour. The results do not establish a total of four marbles.",
